# Auth and RBAC Rules

Use Supabase Auth.

User roles:
- student
- counselor
- admin
- super_admin

Access rules:
- Public pages are open.
- Student dashboard requires student role.
- Counselor dashboard requires counselor/admin/super_admin role.
- Admin dashboard requires admin/super_admin role.
- Super admin can manage admins and platform settings.

Auth requirements:
- Protect dashboards using middleware or server-side checks.
- Never trust client-side role checks alone.
- Fetch role from profiles table.
- Redirect unauthenticated users to login.
- Redirect unauthorized users to a safe page.
- Use server-side Supabase clients for protected data access.
- Validate user ownership before reading or mutating student/application/document records.

Never expose private user data across roles.
